00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:34.210
On whether Brussels should have cleared that Commerce Bank deal, the case on both sides splits

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:37.110
Europe's competition chief from Berlin and the German bank.

00:06:37.650 --> 00:06:42.310
Theresa Rivera said Europe needs stronger banks that can compete, grow and support businesses

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:47.050
and families, and that cross-border mergers help those banks run more efficiently and ride

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:47.550
