00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:53.110
She said the clearance protects competition and choice because the commission found no competition problem.

00:06:53.450 --> 00:06:58.630
Brussels this year also set out to rewrite merger rules so it can build what it calls European champions.

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:05.110
Berlin and Commerce Bank fought the bid because Commerce Bank is a main lender to small and mid-sized German industrial firms.

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:09.910
The fight was fierce and UniCredit still assembled a stake of nearly 50%.

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:14.730
The commission has approved the purchase and the reporting names no further vote or closing date.

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:18.959
